{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_sdd_sdd", "label": "SDD \u2014 Documento de Dise\u00f1o de Software", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_sdd_wompi", "label": "Wompi (pasarela de pagos)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Web Checkout de Bancolombia: PSE + tarjetas, firma de integridad SHA-256(ref + centavos + COP + secreto) y webhook firmado. No acepta par\u00e1metros para filtrar medios de pago."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_vercel", "label": "Vercel (hosting y funciones)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Proyecto `chocata`, plan Hobby; existe un duplicado `landing-page-chocata` pendiente de borrar. Uso comercial exige Pro o migrar a Cloudflare."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_vercel_blob", "label": "Vercel Blob privado (pedidos)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pedidos/REFERENCIA.json privados (Ley 1581); las funciones de Vercel no tienen disco persistente; en local se refleja en la carpeta .pedidos/."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_brevo", "label": "Brevo (correo transaccional)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gratis 300 correos/d\u00eda; remitente pedidos@chocata.com.co con DKIM del dominio. El bloqueo por IP debe estar apagado porque Vercel usa IPs din\u00e1micas."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_callmebot", "label": "CallMeBot (aviso WhatsApp)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Servicio gratuito de aficionado, sin garant\u00eda de entrega; suficiente para avisos al propio n\u00famero. Corrompe las secuencias $1, por eso los montos se escriben \u00abCOP 115.500\u00bb. Si el aviso se vuelve cr\u00edtico, migrar a WhatsApp Business API o Twilio dentro de api/_avisos.js."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_gemini", "label": "Google Gemini (IA)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_sdd_sofi", "label": "Sofi (asistente de preguntas)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Instrucciones de 3 niveles: (A) datos de CHOCATA solo del corpus de fichas, (B) nutrici\u00f3n general con ciencia establecida (metaan\u00e1lisis, OMS, NIH, EFSA, ISSN) y honestidad sobre lo no concluyente, (C) cruce composici\u00f3n\u00d7ciencia. Sentinela NO_LO_SE cae a respuesta fija + WhatsApp. Si la IA falla, el bot local contesta lo esencial."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_api_pedido", "label": "api/_pedido.js (n\u00facleo de c\u00e1lculo)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_sdd_webhook", "label": "api/wompi-webhook.js", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Solo el webhook confirma el pago: la redirecci\u00f3n del navegador no prueba nada. Verifica checksum con timingSafeEqual, cruza el monto contra el pedido guardado y los reintentos no duplican avisos (solo se avisa en la primera transici\u00f3n de estado)."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_admin_token", "label": "ADMIN_TOKEN", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Una sola clave admin comparada en tiempo constante (tokenValido); viaja solo en el header x-admin-token, se recuerda por pesta\u00f1a en sessionStorage, jam\u00e1s en URLs ni en el repo."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_csp", "label": "CSP con hashes SHA-256", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "script-src 'self' + jsdelivr + hashes de los bloques inline, sin unsafe-inline. Los hashes se calculan sobre los bytes servidos (LF, no CRLF); si se edita un script inline hay que recalcular su hash en vercel.json o el script deja de ejecutar."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_precio_servidor", "label": "El servidor es la \u00fanica autoridad sobre el dinero", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El navegador jam\u00e1s define un precio: solo manda slugs y cantidades; api/_pedido.js recalcula todo desde el cat\u00e1logo. El carrito no guarda precios (un carrito abandonado nunca vende al precio viejo). Hay una prueba que inyecta un precio y comprueba que el cobro no cambia."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_fallar_cerrado", "label": "Fallar cerrado, avisar ruidoso", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El pedido se guarda ANTES de enviar al pago; un aviso fallido nunca tumba un webhook; los pagos sin pedido conocido se guardan como hu\u00e9rfanos, no se descartan."}, {"id": "docs_sdd_degradacion_elegante", "label": "Degradaci\u00f3n elegante", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Si una pieza externa falla (IA, correo, WhatsApp), la tienda sigue vendiendo. Sin llaves de Wompi el checkout responde 503 e invita a WhatsApp: la tienda no queda rota, queda sin cobrar."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "docs_operacion_runbook", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "docs_prompt_maestro_estudio_prompt_maestro", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "readme_chocata", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "docs_sdd_wompi", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "docs_sdd_vercel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "docs_sdd_vercel_blob", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "docs_sdd_brevo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "docs_sdd_callmebot", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/SDD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sdd_sdd", "target": "docs_sdd_gemini", "relation": "references", 